WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:05.839
Speaker 1: Let's take a look at the latest
between Chris Christie and the failed twice

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:08.760
indicted, twice impeached former President
Donald Trump.

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.930
As you may remember, Donald Trump attacked
Chris Christie for his weight.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:12.930
Listen.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:14.950
Chris Christie is obese, There's no question
about it.

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:19.760
But as I said at the time, several weeks ago,
Donald Trump is also obese.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.831
And one of the real signs of a cult leader,
as is Donald Trump, is that a cult leader

00:00:24.831 --> 00:00:30.940
can criticize others for things that they
themselves could be criticized for, And their

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:34.060
followers don't care about the double standard.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:38.399
They don't care about the person in a glass
house throwing stones or the pot calling the

00:00:38.399 --> 00:00:41.340
kettle black or whatever phrase you want to
use.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:46.469
Here is Chris Christie asked on Fox about
the fact that Trump goes after him for his

00:00:46.469 --> 00:00:50.620
weight and Chris Christie points out Trump's
fat, Trump is also fat.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:51.620
Once Trump started.

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.440
Speaker 3: Hitting back at you on a number
of fronts, he took aim at your weight.

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:55.840
What was your reaction to that?

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.500
Speaker 2: I was like, he saw it on us.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.860
I mean, please.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:04.760
You know, look, Howie, there are tens of millions
of Americans out in your audience watching

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.470
right now who, like me, have struggled with
their weight.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.470
True.

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:09.470
I continue to struggle.

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:10.470
I continue to try to do better.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.950
I mean, so do they.

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:15.229
And what's that got to do with my competence
for office?

00:01:15.229 --> 00:01:20.740
I ran the governorship in New Jersey for eight
years, I think in a very energetic, successful

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.740
way.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:25.259
Responded to Hurricane Sandy, working 20 hours
a day for weeks.

00:01:25.259 --> 00:01:27.310
I don't know what his point is.

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:28.320
You know what it is?

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:29.320
It's like a child.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.909
It's a bully on the schoolyard who teases
you and makes fun of you.

00:01:32.909 --> 00:01:34.229
But here's my message to him.

00:01:34.229 --> 00:01:36.149
I don't care what he says about me.

00:01:36.149 --> 00:01:38.330
I don't care what he thinks about me.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:40.720
And he should take a look in the mirror every
once in a while.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:44.240
Maybe he dropped the weight thing off of his
list of criticisms.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.240
Yeah.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:48.420
Speaker 1: So Chris Christie is completely
correct.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.420
Of course.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:55.570
You might remember that at one point Donald
Trump published this totally corrosive troth

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.659
to troth, essentially where Trump said, quote,
How many times did Chris Christie use the

00:02:00.659 --> 00:02:01.909
word small?

00:02:01.909 --> 00:02:05.079
Does he have a psychological problem with
size?

00:02:05.079 --> 00:02:08.970
Actually, his speech was small and not very
good.

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:09.970
Okay.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:10.970
He goes on.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:17.060
He also posted this Photoshopped meme from
Chris Christie's campaign, open or town hall,

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:22.970
where it looks like Christie is at a buffet
of some kind holding like a massive plate

00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:23.970
of food.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:26.630
And there's a million other examples of this.

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.680
Trump's obese.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:34.340
Remember that Trump claimed, with the help
of Dr. Ronny Jackson, to weigh to 39 and be

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.730
six foot three inches tall.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:40.580
We know that Trump is not six feet three inches
tall.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:46.190
When you see him standing next to a Tom Brady,
for example, or you see him standing next

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:53.069
to Barack Obama, now you realize that Trump
is very much not six three, just being shorter

00:02:53.069 --> 00:02:54.069
than six.

00:02:54.069 --> 00:02:55.450
Three alone would make him obese.

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:57.720
Also, nobody believes he weighs 239.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.370
Somewhere in the two 6270 range seems to make
a lot more sense.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.540
So Trump is obese.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:07.140
But the point here is this is what cult leaders
get away with.

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:14.860
The cult followers allow you to criticize
others for things that are also characteristics

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:16.580
about you.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:22.230
Chris Christie is right to point out to the
Fox News audience Trump is also fat.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:27.120
Now, sure, Chris Christie is more visibly
obese than Trump, There's no doubt about it.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:32.750
But the point I think would be best made here
is to turn this into a losing argument.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:37.170
Instead of saying anything, I'll say, okay,
yeah, I'm overweight, so's Trump.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.819
So we're tens of millions of Americans.

00:03:38.819 --> 00:03:41.510
Is this really the issue that we have facing
us now?

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:45.920
We'll talk about how Chris Christie's polling
has improved and it has improved, but is it

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:47.280
really going anywhere viable?

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.220
We don't really know the answer to that.

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:53.490
We'll see what the reaction is to this latest
commentary from Chris Christie.

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:55.269
But Chris Christie is right.

00:03:55.269 --> 00:05:04.790
Trump's obese.

